3	/**
4	 * Server actions behind the per-server Mods tab (components/customer/gamepanel/v2/ModsPanel.tsx).
5	 *
6	 * The catalogue is searched IN THE DATABASE, paged — Minecraft alone has
7	 * 30,000+ rows, and the old panel loaded the top 400 and filtered those in the
8	 * browser, which is why it looked like a "tiny curated set". Compatibility is
9	 * judged per row by the family's installer (lib/mods/installers/*) against
10	 * THIS server's loader and version.
11	 *
12	 * Every change is a ServerMod status flip + one GAME_MOD_SYNC job queued under
13	 * the per-server lock (lib/mods/queue.ts); the worker does the work and the
14	 * panel follows the job's step/progress. Ownership is checked on every call.
15	 */
