        {m.toggle.allowed && m.toggle.contentRisk && <p className="rounded-[10px] border border-amber-500/30 bg-amber-500/[0.07] px-3 py-2 text-amber-300">This mod may add things to your world; they&apos;re deleted the next time those areas load and save without it. Back up the world first if you might want them.</p>}
        {m.toggle.allowed && m.status === "INSTALLED" && <p className="text-tx-faint">Only want it off for now? Use its switch instead — that keeps it installed.</p>}
      </div>
